{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# RAID 磁盘阵列\n\n把数据切割后分散存放在多块盘上：分散读写提升性能，副本/校验信息保障安全。","x":-200,"y":-360,"width":400,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"compare","type":"text","text":"## 常见 RAID 级别对比\n\n||RAID 0|RAID 1|RAID 5|RAID 6|RAID 10|\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n|最少硬盘数|2|2|3|4|4|\n|可用容量|n|1（最小盘）|n-1|n-2|n/2|\n|读性能|高|中高|高|高|高|\n|写性能|高|中|中|较低|高|\n|允许坏盘数|0|n-1|1|2|每组各1块|\n|典型场景|缓存/临时|系统盘|NAS|大容量存储|数据库/生产|","x":-980,"y":-140,"width":1560,"height":260,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"img-raid0","type":"file","file":"linux/RAID与LVM/RAID/raid0.svg","x":-980,"y":160,"width":320,"height":160},
		{"id":"img-raid1","type":"file","file":"linux/RAID与LVM/RAID/raid1.svg","x":-620,"y":160,"width":319,"height":259},
		{"id":"img-raid5","type":"file","file":"linux/RAID与LVM/RAID/raid5.svg","x":-260,"y":160,"width":340,"height":196},
		{"id":"img-raid6","type":"file","file":"linux/RAID与LVM/RAID/raid6.svg","x":120,"y":160,"width":320,"height":185},
		{"id":"img-raid10","type":"file","file":"linux/RAID与LVM/RAID/raid10.svg","x":480,"y":160,"width":320,"height":185},
		{"id":"raid0","type":"text","text":"## RAID 0 — 条带化\n\n- 数据切块轮流写入各盘\n- 吞吐量约为单盘 n 倍\n- **无冗余**，坏一块全丢\n- 适合缓存/swap/临时盘","x":-980,"y":460,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"raid1","type":"text","text":"## RAID 1 — 镜像\n\n- 每盘存完全相同数据\n- 可用容量 = 1 块盘\n- 只要剩一块盘就能工作，冗余最高\n- 系统盘/引导盘常用","x":-620,"y":460,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"raid5","type":"text","text":"## RAID 5 — 分布式校验\n\n- 数据+校验（Parity）分散存储\n- 校验用 XOR：A⊕B=P\n- 与 RAID 3 区别：校验块轮流分布，而非集中在一块盘\n- 可用容量 = n-1\n- 允许坏 1 块，**重建期间再坏一块就全完**","x":-260,"y":460,"width":340,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"raid6","type":"text","text":"## RAID 6 — 双重校验\n\n- RAID 5 增强版，两种校验算法（P+Q）\n- 允许同时坏 2 块盘\n- 可用容量 = n-2，写性能更低\n- 大容量盘（4TB+）场景更安全","x":120,"y":460,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"raid10","type":"text","text":"## RAID 10 — 先镜像再条带\n\n- 两两做 RAID1，再做 RAID0\n- 兼具高性能与高安全\n- 可用容量 = n/2\n- \"最多坏50%\"前提：坏盘分布在不同镜像组","x":480,"y":460,"width":320,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"raid1001","type":"text","text":"### RAID 10 vs RAID 01\n\n| |RAID 10|RAID 01|\n|---|---|---|\n|结构|1→0|0→1|\n|扩展性|好|差|\n|容错|每组独立坏1块|一组坏就崩|\n|结论|**生产首选**|几乎无人用|","x":480,"y":740,"width":320,"height":220,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"choose","type":"text","text":"## 选型指南\n\n- 数据可丢、极致速度 → **RAID 0**\n- 系统盘/引导盘 → **RAID 1**\n- 大容量文件存储、成本敏感 → **RAID 5**（≤2TB）/ **RAID 6**（>2TB）\n- 数据库/核心业务 → **RAID 10**\n- Homelab/NAS → 优先 ZFS（mirror/raidz）","x":-980,"y":760,"width":1300,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"mdadm","type":"text","text":"## mdadm 常用参数\n\n|参数|功能|\n|---|---|\n|-C|创建阵列|\n|-n|设备数量|\n|-l|RAID 级别|\n|-x|备用盘数量|\n|-D|查看详情|\n|-S|停止阵列|\n|-a|添加设备|\n|-f|标记故障|\n|-r|移除设备|","x":-980,"y":1020,"width":700,"height":320,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"mdadm-create","type":"text","text":"### 创建 RAID 10\n\n```bash\nmdadm -Cv /dev/md0 -n 4 -l 10 \\\n  /dev/sdb /dev/sdc /dev/sdd /dev/sde\nmkfs.ext4 /dev/md0\nmount /dev/md0 /raid\n```\n\n### 创建带热备的 RAID 5\n\n```bash\nmdadm -Cv /dev/md0 -n 3 -l 5 -x 1 \\\n  /dev/sdb /dev/sdc /dev/sdd /dev/sde\n```","x":-240,"y":1020,"width":560,"height":320,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"mdadm-fail","type":"text","text":"### 磁盘故障处理\n\n```bash\nmdadm /dev/md0 -f /dev/sdb   # 标记故障\nmdadm /dev/md0 -r /dev/sdb   # 移除\nmdadm /dev/md0 -a /dev/sdf   # 添加新盘\nmdadm -D /dev/md0            # 查看重建进度\n```\n\ndegraded=降级，recovering=重建中","x":380,"y":1020,"width":420,"height":320,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"img-rebuild","type":"file","file":"linux/RAID与LVM/RAID/raid-rebuild.svg","x":-260,"y":1380,"width":420,"height":225,"color":"1"}
	],
